{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019kxoQXeMb4sxEVfZhjsuDL","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSynthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\n2\tExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\n3\tThe ASGI framing host injects verified_identity; request bodies cannot set it. Each identity has a tenant. Jobs hold tenant-specific results. Handles may appear in shared support URLs; possession grants no authority. Every result/cancel endpoint must enforce tenant ownership. The supplied api/store modules are the complete API authorization paths. Work execution, audit retention, ingress validation and identity-provider internals are external. Cancellation's worker effect is outside scope. There is no MCP TypeScript SDK or OAuth client in this Python component.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9aacdaf3-7f52-4968-8095-afd81c712510","uuid":"97dcb4c6-80d3-4f25-9e9a-ff2674470b95","timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:28:38.870Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-grader-vl2s0m5z/repo/README.md","content":"Synthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\nExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\nThe ASGI framing host injects verified_identity; request bodies cannot set it. Each identity has a tenant. Jobs hold tenant-specific results. Handles may appear in shared support URLs; possession grants no authority. Every result/cancel endpoint must enforce tenant ownership. The supplied api/store modules are the complete API authorization paths. Work execution, audit retention, ingress validation and identity-provider internals are external. Cancellation's worker effect is outside scope. There is no MCP TypeScript SDK or OAuth client in this Python component.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019kxoQXeMb4sxEVfZhjsuDL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
